win cool prizes!/Lukas, Copenhagen, Denmark;Double tap to activate your Hoverboards!/Ahmad, Selangor, Malaysia;Login to Facebook to earn more rewards!/Mikael, Kumasi, Ghana;Use Hoverboards to survive a crash!/Daniel, Vicensa, Italy;Remember to Double Up your items whenever possible!/Amar, Gothenburg, Sweden;Use Trains and other objects to stay as high in the air as possible!/Roberto, Knokke, Belgium;Try to stay as high in the air as possible!/Cooper, Dubbo, Australia;Use Hoverboards! If things get too hectic an explosion will clear the stage!/Meighan, Alberta, Canada;Super Jump with Hoverboards and Super Sneakers to get over the Trains!/Mostafa, Alexandria, Egypt;Invite your friends to play Subway Surfers for more fun!/Eelis, HÃ¤meenlinna, Finland;Try to be on the roof of every Train as long as possible!/Amber, Cambridge, England;Use the Power Jumper to jump up onto the tunnels!/Thomas, Colorado, USA;Fully upgrade the Freestyler Board to get both Double Jump and Super Jump!/Musthapa, Sarawak, Malaysia;With the upgraded Monster board you can jump over the Trains, and it is also really fast!/Lasse, Birkelse, Denmark;Some Hoverboards have upgrades that make them faster!/Mansoor, Sindh, Pakistan;Open more Mystery Boxes in the Terrific Tuesday event and win mega prizes!/Sunil, Mumbai, India;Use the Bouncer board to pick up Coins from below!/Fakhry, Victoria, Malaysia;Get the Bouncer board to enjoy Super Sneakers and Hoverboard features at the same time!/Joshua, Maine, USA;You can cancel jumps by rolling in mid air!/Joshua, Maine, USA;You can hop on barriers to get onto trains!/Rachel, Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam;To collect the High Jumper Awards get help from the Bouncer board!/Salman, Hyderabad, India;Don't forget the Daily Challenge! It rewards Super Mystery Boxes!/Liliane, YaoundÃ©, Cameroun;Earn Awards to get more Keys!          ˆ              http://hoodrunner.kiloo.com'   http://redirect.kiloo.com/subwayapp.php              x   *   aIN0UXP4NNoANVGi5w3raGAFN1